Looking at the error, the `query_ai_assistant` call failed — most likely because the schema used a `datetime` field (which can fail validation when the model returns a slightly malformed timestamp) and because passing the entire received-emails list made the prompt unwieldy. I'll narrow the candidate emails with a read-only search first, and simplify the output schema to only the fields we actually need (as plain strings).

```python
