The `query_ai_assistant` call is failing again. Two likely culprits: (1) the `model_dump_json()` output is heavily escaped and hard for the model to parse, and (2) the schema may be too strict if the exact match is ambiguous. Let me pass the emails as clean plain text (subject/from/body) and keep the output schema minimal and unambiguous. I'll also broaden the candidate search to make sure the reset email is actually among the candidates.

